WEBVTT

00:00:29.022 --> 00:00:31.232
(Smijeh)

00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:35.208
(Pljesak)

00:00:37.266 --> 00:00:40.765
Vidjeli smo četiri američka predsjednika.

00:00:40.765 --> 00:00:42.096
Obamu, naravno.

00:00:42.096 --> 00:00:44.510
Oh, Europljani su ga stvarno voljeli.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.805
Bio je multilateralist.

00:00:46.805 --> 00:00:48.047
Volio je diplomaciju.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:50.407
Htio se sprijateljiti s Iranom.

00:00:51.187 --> 00:00:55.815
(Smijeh)

00:00:57.831 --> 00:00:58.989
I onda...